  "solution": {
    "text": "Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is differentiable, &nbsp;it&nbsp;must be continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> ... <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" equalrows=\"true\" equalcolumns=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><br />Now, for <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>1</mn> <mo>&#8722;</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> ... <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />From equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
